  "assumptions": [
    "Analytical luma-only FSIM schedule with the fixed factor in derived.F. Measured through Fsim::score_luma8 on unmerged fix/fsim-fixed-luma (PR 92); this is not a master CLI route. Existing count-model qualifications remain.",
    "F=4 at every size. Uses the existing zero-padded separable box decimation and reference anchor. All other inherited count qualifications remain.",
    "Phase congruency (phasecong2, kernel.rs:928-1014): NSCALE=4 x NORIENT=4 log-Gabor filters (kernel.rs:24-36). Per image: 1 fwd FFT2 + per (o,s) filter-multiply + IFFT2 + anacc; per orientation xenergy + energy fold + noise median + ethr; pcdiv.",
    "FFT cost modeled as 5*N*log2(N) flops (radix-2 complex, radix-4/mixed similarly): fwd fft per el ~ 2 mul + 3 add per log2 level; written as per-el mul 2*log2(n2), add 3*log2(n2). Filter bank build = 16 extra IFFTs + freq grids + filters, CACHED per size (kernel.rs:905-917): counted once as implementation-class stage (amortized across pairs; for a single pair it is real work).",
    "anacc per el per (o,s): se+=re, so+=im, sa+=sqrt(re^2+im^2). xenergy per el per o: unit phase vector (sqrt+2div). energy per el per (o,s): An*(cos-dphi-|sin-dphi|) ~9 flops. noise: |eo0|^2 + median estimate. ethr: max(0,E-T) + 2 accumulates.",
    "Gradients: conv2_same_3x3 with DX/DY Scharr kernels (kernel.rs:578-675; 9 fma incl zeros), grad = sqrt(ix^2+iy^2).",
    "Pool (kernel.rs:1054-1080): pcsim=(2ab+T1)/(a^2+b^2+T1), gsim, product, pcm=max, num/den f64. fsim-y has no I/Q/chroma terms."
  ],
